# INVWINDA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: an item dragged
# from the split view's contents onto the tree with the driver's mouse
# lines.  Moved more than the threshold, the drag starts: the help panel
# says so and the contents' box holds the mouse.  Over a tree row that
# row alone is framed as the drop target, the tree's selection and the
# contents kept; on the tree's header line or below its last row none
# is.  Item 2, dropped on Box B2 where it is, does nothing; dropped on
# the contents, on the splitter or below the tree's rows, item 1 stays.
# Dropped on Box B2 it moves there as Move moves it: the note, the
# contents loaded again, the tree as it was; the tree's selection, kept
# through the drags, moves down to Shelf A1, whose contents follow.
# Item 3 dropped on Office leaves them, counted again; with Shelf A1's
# own items alone (Everything below off) the contents hold only their empty text, which no
# press drags.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINDA.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/dragchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 2
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 2 8 0
S DRAGGED
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
S OVERB2
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 1
S OVERA1
M 208 MOVE HEAD 0
S OVERHEAD
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2 0 30
S OVERLOW
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S OWNLOC
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
M 221.1 UP ROW 2
S UPCONT
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
M 220 UP MID
S UPSPLIT
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
M 208.1 UP ROW 2 0 30
S UPLOW
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S MOVED
K ESC
K DOWN
S DOWNA1
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 0
M 208.1 UP ROW 0
S LEFTA1
K ALT-C G
S OWNA1
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 0
S EMPTYDR
M 208.1 UP ROW 0
S EMPTYUP
K ALT-F X
